  "description": "The Dually Wash Pad is built for detailers and enthusiasts who prefer the control of a wash pad over a traditional wash mitt. With no hand pocket or insert, this pad allows you to adjust grip, pressure, and angle freely while washing, giving you better access to tight areas and complex vehicle shapes.Featuring a dual surface microfiber design, the Dually Wash Pad lets you tackle different exterior areas efficiently during a single wash. Plush microfiber fibers work to lift dirt away from paint, clear coat, glass, wheels, and trim while helping reduce friction during contact washing.The flat, ergonomic pad design fits comfortably in the hand and glides smoothly across large panels, while still offering precise control around mirrors, grilles, and lower sections of the vehicle. This makes it an excellent option for users who want more feedback and control than a traditional mitt provides.Compatible with bucket wash methods, foam cannons, and foam guns, the Dually Wash Pad integrates seamlessly into any exterior wash routine. Its durable microfiber construction is machine washable and reusable, making it a dependable tool for repeated use.Whether you are performing a quick maintenance wash or a more thorough exterior clean, the Dually Wash Pad delivers flexibility, control, and consistent cleaning performance.",
